Thanks.

ipc/ doesn't have a listed maintainer, but Davidlohr usually helps out.

> --- a/ipc/shm.c
> +++ b/ipc/shm.c
> @@ -1677,12 +1677,16 @@ long do_shmat(int shmid, char __user *shmaddr, int shmflg,
