Fixes: ec8f5d8f6f76 ("crypto: qce - Qualcomm crypto engine driver")
Tested-by: Kuldeep Singh <kuldeep.singh@oss.qualcomm.com>
Signed-off-by: Bartosz Golaszewski <bartosz.golaszewski@oss.qualcomm.com>
